# Agon 08_sand_casualpirates layers 6+7: metroid u0547 latches onto the player (god mode) and
# drains; the player morphs and lays bombs while held, unmorphs, then a power bomb. CMetroid
# player arms: Attack, SuckEnergyFromTarget, ComputeSuckPlayerPosRot, DetachFromTarget.
@f300 layer 6
@f340 layer 7
@f560 god 1; give morphBall 1; give morphBallBombs 1; give powerBombs 5; fastmorph 1
@f580 send u0547 Activate; send u053d Activate

@f620 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f700 obj u0547
@f760 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 Attack
@f800 obj u0547
@f900 obj u0547; status
@f1000 obj u0547; status
@f1100 press x 4
@f1200 obj u0547; status
@f1260 press a 2
@f1300 obj u0547
@f1400 press x 4
@f1500 obj u0547; status
@f1600 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 Attack
@f1800 obj u0547; status
@f1900 damage u0547 50 0 powerbomb
@f2000 obj u0547; status
@f2100 place u053d player 2; fsm u053d SelectTarget
@f2200 press x 4
@f2300 place u053d player 2; fsm u053d Attack
@f2400 obj u053d; status
@f2700 obj u053d; status
@f2800 press y 2
@f2900 obj u053d; status
